hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"236","Narrated by Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al-Makhzoumi, narrated by Sufyan, on the authority of Asim Al-Ahwal. H. Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala’, narrated to us Sufyan, narrated to us Asim bin Sulaiman Al-Ahwal, on the authority of Muadhah, on the authority of Aisha, may God Almighty be pleased with her, She said: “The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and I used to wash from one vessel, and I would say: Leave for me, leave for me.”"
